      "text": "SPECIFIC CONNECTIONS, NOT A PREREQUISITE CHAIN\nQ5(b) fractional relaxation supplies Q7(b)'s upper bound.\nQ6's DP paradigm is used in Q8(c); Q2(a)'s classes connect with Q8(a).",
